# Byte-exact storage. SHA256SUMS freezes the sha256 of every file in this
# package and scripts/verify_manifest.py hashes the WORKING-TREE bytes, so a
# clone on a machine with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite every file to CRLF
# and fail the integrity check before anyone had touched anything.
#
# `-text` disables newline translation on add and checkout. Do not remove or
# narrow this without re-freezing SHA256SUMS.
* -text
